---
Builds native application hosts and generates plugin registration

Usage: leptoskit native [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  bundle    Compiles the native Wasm guest and compatibility descriptor for code push
  prepare   Regenerates host projects and registrants and compiles their Rust inputs
  build     Produces an Apple, Windows, or Linux application, Android APK, or HarmonyOS HAP
  platform  Lists and scaffolds in-tree platform extensions
  help      Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --app-target <NAME>  Select a named target from the root leptoskit.toml
  -h, --help               Print help
  -V, --version            Print version
